        "raw": "[quote=\"Foote\"]\n\nAh. Games Keep. I purchased the original printing of Sentinels there many moons ago. I live in the city so the Keep is not far. I also recommend Redcaps Corner here in the city as another great place to game.&nbsp;If you are planning on attending, I might try and attend myself!\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nRedcaps Corner is around 38th Street IIRC?&nbsp; Been there once back around when they opened.&nbsp; I live in the city as well, but get out to West Chester every other week or so.&nbsp; There&#39;s also gaming up in Langhorne at the Oxford Valley Mall a few Saturdays a month, but I have not been up there for a while.&nbsp; Haven&#39;t checked out what the gaming scene is in city for a while.\n",
